@startuml
!include skin.iuml
participant "GitHub Actions\n(daily or manual)" as G
participant "warm-cache.mjs" as W
participant "Globalping API" as P
participant "Probes in\nUS / EU / Asia / ..." as PR
participant "Cloudflare edge\nin each region" as E
G -> W : run with GLOBALPING_TOKEN
W -> W : read /sitemap.xml\nbuild URL list
W -> W : budget = 80% of hourly allowance\n(500/h with a token)
loop each URL x location batch
  W -> P : POST measurement (HTTP GET)
  P -> PR : run from real networks
  PR -> E : GET page
  E --> PR : MISS first time, now cached
  PR --> P : status + cf-cache-status
  P --> W : result
end
W -> W : stop politely on HTTP 429
W --> G : summary: HIT / MISS counts per region
note right of W
New project? It appears in the sitemap,
so the next run warms it. After an
import, purge then run the workflow.
end note
@enduml
